/-- For theta > 0, a nonzero measure sigma with ell > 0 sigma-a.e., and w integrable with w > 0 sigma-a.e. (supplied hypotheses), ell -> 2*theta/(2*theta + ell) * w ell is integrable with integral strictly below the integral of w. -/
